#: scenario8:scenario8_6971D90D_6A3C_4F04_901C_F6B27FFBCE89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 671530a329ed2a276c25834e7162b10e83641eb68ee53befa6d5109cbcd6416c
