#: scenario8:scenario8_F480A4C3_8233_4415_B4ED_CE9DAD21C337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a85115b73777aaede8ff9db84c40e5be95aa14a3cee910664b091551f651928d
